{"question_text": {"৪৯তম বিসিএস ⎯ গণিত (৫৫১)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) Which of the following is not an order property?", "option1": "Trichotomy", "option2": "Transitivity", "option3": "Distributivity", "option4": "Additive property", "answer": "3", "exp": "<div>Order properties are<br>1. The Trichotomy Property<br>2. Transitive Property<br>3. Multiplication Property of Inequality<br>4. Addition Property of Inequality</div>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Untitled_ljqHXCU.jpg\" width=\"886\" height=\"96\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "Chebyshev's Inequality", "option2": "&nbsp;Jensen's Inequality", "option3": "AM ≥ GM", "option4": "None of the above", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_oBu4HtW.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"136\"></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Which of the following is true for positive real numbers?", "option1": "AM × HM = GM<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "AM + HM = 2GM", "option3": "AM = GM = HM", "option4": "None of the above", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_WHftXIp.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"802\" height=\"138\"></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) For two positive real numbers a, b the inequality (a - b)<sup>2 </sup>≥ 0 implies:", "option1": "AM ≥ GM", "option2": "HM ≥ GM", "option3": "AM ≤ GM", "option4": "GM = AM", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_Fbbdazn.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"680\" height=\"98\"></p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) which one of the following is Chebyshev’s Inequality?", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_zGiSyEN.png\" width=\"359\" height=\"92\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_C4ifnA8.jpg\" width=\"367\" height=\"90\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_CwpTTxJ.jpg\" width=\"365\" height=\"88\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_AL6BRKv.jpg\" width=\"361\" height=\"91\" alt=\"\">", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_QA3angP.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"240\"></p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_rl5dVDh.jpg\" width=\"486\" height=\"86\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "0 ≤ m ≤ 1", "option2": "0 &lt; m &lt; 1", "option3": "m &lt; 0 or m &gt; 1", "option4": "None if these", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_TMwXWD5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"382\" height=\"130\"></p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) If |x - 1| &lt; (1/10) then which of the following is true?", "option1": "|x<sup>2 </sup>- 1| &gt; (21/100)", "option2": "|x<sup>2 </sup>- 1| &lt; (21/100)", "option3": "|x<sup>2 </sup>- 1| &lt; (19/100)", "option4": "|x<sup>2 </sup>- 1| &gt; (19/100)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_qsPTVEO.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"671\" height=\"293\"></p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-12_175948.png\" width=\"636\" height=\"124\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "3/2", "option2": "0", "optio