m/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2025-08-12_181306.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"763\" height=\"222\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2_TYduFmm.png\" width=\"662\" height=\"59\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "0", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_cD1C7LG.jpg\" width=\"264\" height=\"63\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "2<sup>51</sup>", "option4": "2<sup>50</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_LBJDRZm.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"986\" height=\"217\"></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_IWsDrLD.jpg\" width=\"696\" height=\"94\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "1", "option2": "- 1", "option3": "i", "option4": "- i", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_rZZ1GPU.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"780\" height=\"108\"></p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) If x<sup>2 </sup>+ x + 1 = 0 Find the value of x<sup>3</sup>", "option1": "0", "option2": "1", "option3": "i", "option4": "-1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>if x<sup>2 </sup>+ x + 1 = 0 then x = ω<br>then x<sup>3 </sup>= ω<sup>3 </sup>= 1</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) If z = x + iy then what is the locus of ।z + 3। = 9", "option1": "circle", "option2": "parabola", "option3": "ellipse", "option4": "straight line", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_LEfz2iA.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"198\"><br>so , ।z+3।=9 represents a circle</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) The principal argument of&nbsp; − 1 + i is:", "option1": "π/4&nbsp;", "option2": "- π/4", "option3": "3π/4", "option4": "- 3π/4", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><br>​<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_XdJzQsQ.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"232\"></p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_wwIKdPO.jpg\" width=\"772\" height=\"78\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "16", "option2": "- 16", "option3": "1", "option4": "0", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><sup><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_Je8d7Iw.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"578\" height=\"123\"></sup></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) which one of the following is true if z<sub>1</sub>, z<sub>2</sub> are complex number?&nbsp;", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_GsY4fLI.jpg\" width=\"254\" height=\"60\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_2BKfI22.jpg\" width=\"233\" height=\"69\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_FyVQNNr.jpg\" width=\"172\" height=\"85\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_58A932A.jpg\" width=\"364\" height=\"62\" alt=\"\">", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>see the properties of complex conjugate</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) <span id=\"mce_1_start\">The 5th roots of 1 + i are:</span>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_g8GqCbM.jpg\" width=\"341\" height=\"66\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_egnOvoK.jpg\" width=\"621\" height=\"49\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_luRbip4.jpg\" width=\"599\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "None of these", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_GIqYaDq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"672\" height=\"354\"></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) <strong>If a &gt; b , then a <sup>2</sup> &gt; b <sup>2&nbsp;</sup> only when:</strong>", "option1": "a, b both positive&nbsp;<sup></sup>", "option2": "Always true", "option3": "never true", "option4": "<span id=\"mce_2_start\"></span>None of these<span id=\"mce_2_end\"></span>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>for all positve real number a&gt;b<br>we get    a<sup>2</sup>&gt;b<sup>2</sup></p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) which of the following is triangle inequality?&nbsp;", "option1": "Ιa + bΙ ≤ ΙaΙ + ΙbΙ", "option2": "Ιa + bΙ ≥ ΙaΙ + ΙbΙ<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option3": "Ιa + bΙ = ΙaΙ + Ι b Ι<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option4": "Ιa - bΙ ≤ ΙaΙ - ΙbΙ<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>see lecture 1<br><br></p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) which one of the following is completeness axiom?", "option1": "<span id=\"mce_1_start\">Every nonempty set of real numbers that is bounded above has a greatest lower bound (infimum) in R</span>", "option2": "Every nonempty set of real numbers that is bounded above has many least upper bound (supremum) in R<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option3": "<span id=\"mce_1_start\">Every nonempty set of real numbers that is bounded above has a least upper bound (supremum) in R</span>", "option4": "none&nbsp;", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>completeness axiom of real number is <br>''Every nonempty set of real numbers that is bounded above has a least upper bound (supremum) in R''</p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) which one of the following is an example of multiplication property ?", "option1": "if a &gt; b then&nbsp; - 3a &gt; - 3b", "option2": "<span id=\"mce_1_start\">if a &gt; b then - 3a &lt; - 3b</span>", "option3": "if a &gt; b then - 3a ≤ - 3b<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option4": "none&nbsp;", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>See \"Multiplication Property of Inequality\" in order axiom<br><br></p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) <span id=\"mce_1_start\">Which of the following statements is false?</span>", "option1": "|a| = -a if a &lt; 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option2": "|a| = a if a ≥ 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option3": "|a| &lt; 0 for all a ≠ 0<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "option4": "|a| ≥ 0 for all a ∈ R<span id=\"mce_1_start\"></span>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>Absolute value is never negative.</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) solve the equation using Demoiver's theorem<br>(x + 1)<sup>5</sup>+(x - 1)<sup>5</sup>=0", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_wIA6mPI.jpg\" width=\"221\" height=\"96\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_wlHKmRW.jpg\" width=\"204\" height=\"88\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_PuTMfJG.jpg\" width=\"192\" height=\"84\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_FaignaL.jpg\" width=\"179\" height=\"95\" alt=\"\">", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>use this short technique <br><br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_UXPkNaZ.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"111\"></p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) <span id=\"mce_1_start\">If a, b, c &gt; 0 which of the following is true</span>", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_bi2EJUo.jpg\" width=\"386\" height=\"66\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_t3ducQA.jpg\" width=\"372\" height=\"66\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_YKjI8wK.jpg\" width=\"358\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "none", "answer": "1", "exp": "<div><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_Amqc3e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"382\"></div>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) <span id=\"mce_3_start\"></span>If&nbsp; a, b &gt; 0 and&nbsp; a + b = 1, find the maximum value of ab.", "option1": "0", "option2": "1/4", "option3": "1", "option4": "1/2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_merJrbN.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"70\"></p>"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_HZMmy5Q.jpg\" width=\"1041\" height=\"92\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_tPZD6Mw.jpg\" width=\"333\" height=\"55\" alt=\"\">", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_YxlDokQ.jpg\" width=\"325\" height=\"41\" alt=\"\">", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_OrYwSp3.jpg\" width=\"314\" height=\"62\" alt=\"\">", "option4": "none", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_Gc0M2x7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"64\"></p>"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) <span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\">Chebyshev’s inequality applies only when sequences are:</span>", "option1": "Both monotonic in the same sense (both increasing or both decreasing<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option2": "One increasing and one decreasing<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option3": "One constant and one increasing<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "option4": "None<span id=\"mce_1_start\" style=\"overflow: hidden; line-height: 0px;\"></span>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>The classical Chebyshev inequality requires both sequences to be similarly monotonic.</p>"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) solve x<sup>2 </sup>- 7x + 12 &lt; 0", "option1": "2 &lt; x &lt; 5", "option2": "3 &lt; x &lt; 4", "option3": "x &lt; 3 or x &gt; 4", "option4": "2 &lt; x &lt; 6", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2 </sup>- 7x + 12 &lt;0<br>or, (x - 3)(x - 4) &lt; 0<br>so  3 &lt; x &lt; 4</p>"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 12290, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "1800000", "is_omr": true, "omr_time": "2100000", "examname": "Aug 13, 2025", "type": "Math-Sub-551", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}